  "description": "Archive of global numerical weather prediction model output from the Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), Germany's national meteorological service, covering the ICON Global and ICON ART Global (aerosol and reactive trace gas) models. Includes ensemble forecast runs and historical forecast data, originally produced in GRIB2 and republished in Zarr/Icechunk format with near-global spatial coverage.",
